      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "Simplify $\\frac{{z}^{-8}}{{z}^{-2}}.$",
      "worked_solution": "We subtract the exponents, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{z}^{-8}}{{z}^{-2}} & = \\\\ {z}^{-8-(-2)} & = \\\\ {z}^{-8+2} & = \\\\ {z}^{-6} & = \\\\ \\frac{1}{{z}^{6}}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
