      "name": "Question 5",
      "problem": "Simplify $\\frac{{u}^{-4}}{{u}^{-7}}.$",
      "worked_solution": "We subtract the exponents, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{u}^{-4}}{{u}^{-7}} & = \\\\ {u}^{-4-(-7)} & = \\\\ {u}^{-4+7} & = \\\\ {u}^{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
